            "id": "17909711997462990",
            "caption": "Want to be more involved with AASA? JOIN AASA BOARD!! Apply to be an AASA First Year Rep!\n\nApply through our Linktree in the bio or here: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScqaJ0WismbMAoFa6Bmx3S4xAzx8q0W1YbuqRbC0azF2kginQ/viewform?usp=header\n\nAs a FYR, you’ll plan events, serve as a liaison between AASA and the rest of the first year community, develop leadership skills, and (most importantly) make friends!!\n\nWe are hosting office hours for questions about the role, application tips, or just to get to know you better! Come find us on 9/1 and 9/7 from 6-9 PM on Lau 2. Reach out to one of AASA’s presidents, Aqib Khan (ask180) or Russell Choi (rc1740) with any questions.\n\nApplications are due September 9th at 11:59 PM!",
