          {
            "id": "18090906785448178",
            "caption": "The MSA is so excited to welcome the incoming freshmen to Georgetown! In the meantime, join our Class of 2030 group chat through the link in our bio to connect with fellow Muslim students and start getting to know your new community. We also have a google doc with answers to some frequently asked questions available through our Linktree. If you have any other questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to us anytime!\n\nWe can’t wait to meet you all soon, inshaAllah!",
