          {
            "id": "18449178625142645",
            "caption": "The Georgetown University Muslim Students Association mourns the passing of Dr. John L. Esposito, Distinguished University Professor Emeritus and founding director of the Prince Alwaleed Bin Talal Center for Muslim-Christian Understanding (ACMCU).\n\nDr. Esposito dedicated his career to advancing the study and understanding of Islam while fostering meaningful dialogue between faith communities. Through his scholarship, teaching, and public engagement, he helped shape conversations on Islam and Muslim-Christian relations for generations. His work to challenge Islamophobia and promote pluralism has left a lasting impact at Georgetown and far beyond.\n\nAs members of Georgetown’s Muslim community, we are deeply grateful for his lifelong commitment to promoting greater understanding, compassion, and justice. His legacy will continue to inspire students, scholars, and all those working toward a more informed and inclusive world.\n\nWe extend our sincere condolences to Dr. Esposito’s family, friends, colleagues, students, and the entire ACMCU community during this difficult time.",
            "media_type": "IMAGE",
            "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/742786949_18544551085072007_1531165365968819990_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=6lzYBAQTyLkQ7kNvwH7RoKO&_nc_oc=AdoT8gRWWi2i0U_pAwL2aZXc45AdPFAaA3obLjN0JtE7Wmbd0QW56O32hIyCwz_dx0pe5PUllOPgJ3dcO_5NjDNb&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&_nc_gid=I4sfXyllVHtBM5zlHLZyJw&oh=00_AQKzcqufsAxSizlf3__04g-iSDs1FBB9eXpV9zaxamRErw&oe=6A9FBAEA",
