    {
      "id": "17841408076571479",
      "username": "georgetownentrepreneurship",
      "name": "Georgetown Entrepreneurship",
      "profile_picture_url": "https://scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.2885-15/33313388_277823586091820_2560442451407929344_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=7d201b&_nc_ohc=RvRvN7kccNcQ7kNvwEoR4HX&_nc_oc=AdoC7_QgaOzI5Iel4qoB1ZAVo5CWj66OKJ-pfqfc0_tQycrs19m5mobwu2cRPK9ckZSfckDv5U7dUjBsYx32f2sK&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.xx&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&oh=00_AQLoSiLna9WnLXdOwPMEByPD34Kp_0kw2R2Y4r7fHg9WIA&oe=6A9FB892",
      "media": {
        "data": [
          {
            "id": "18012583346748222",
            "caption": "RAM Infrastructure joins the Leonsis Venture Lab! 💙\n\nWe're thrilled to welcome RAM Infrastructure to the Georgetown entrepreneurship community. Founded by Rob Munroe (B'17), RAM is a project development firm tackling one of the most pressing challenges of our time: building the infrastructure platforms needed to support the economy of tomorrow, from energy and data to high-tech supply chains.\n\nWe can't wait to see what they build next!\n\n🔗  Read the full announcement: https://bit.ly/4gyfbxX\n🔗 Join the Leonsis Venture Lab: https://bit.ly/462l0O8\n\n#leonsisventurelab #studentfounders #entreprenuership",
            "media_type": "IMAGE",
            "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/790803523_18342560782269220_4757123788825120023_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=7zBxBbOdxVMQ7kNvwFMpZfO&_nc_oc=AdoB96wK0nYw6fMj2HAn6Qhf6UlLta6qte6pgUUTScS7VijIto4w8zWohJGmxqFTZsRWQu8rbknF02N39b1FxSCt&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&_nc_gid=SJagr1iFeZall-A2QSKpHw&oh=00_AQLbElHg2cKne-dkFA6aUOwtjB2hldTnDVR4tnEO-HDFrA&oe=6A9FCDD8",
            "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DczB4WaCeda/",
            "timestamp": "2026-09-02T19:51:31+0000"
          },
          {
            "id": "18100568129189183",
            "caption": "🚀 Got two minutes and a big idea?\n\nRocket Pitch is your chance to turn that spark into something real, and thousands of dollars are on the line.\n\nGeorgetown's elevator pitch competition is open to any student with an early-stage idea. You don't need a fully built company. You just need a problem worth solving.\n\n📹 Submit a 2-minute video pitch by September 15th @ 11:59PM\n\n📢 Finalists will be announced on September 24th\n\n🏆 Live Finals: October 1st @ 5PM, Lohrfink Auditorium\n\n👉 Apply to Pitch: https://bit.ly/4vnccwg\n🔗 More Information: https://bit.ly/3QSogaZ\n\n#pitchcompetition #studentfounders #entrepreneurship",
            "media_type": "IMAGE",
            "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/762310620_18337984159269220_1934869568858199212_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=111&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=M7uoADH3oIQQ7kNvwGRXtAH&_nc_oc=Ado8lyhRAY6iSsArl-d1nzbggmlVKCJa6psGd61mexxvMQtvY-_o1AB_3UMAWznX-f7oSxBX7vX88I6Ht0aWP1OH&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&_nc_gid=SJagr1iFeZall-A2QSKpHw&oh=00_AQLpNGWY6ts5RSJ-LvHfUvUpKyWBWS2SejFg-5tJBLA07Q&oe=6A9FBDF7",
            "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DblpD_nnw_N/",
            "timestamp": "2026-08-03T18:33:10+0000"
          },
          {
            "id": "18110199667804724",
            "caption": "From personal experience to real-world impact. 💙\n\nShavini Fernando, CEO of OxiWear, built her company out of a commitment to making healthcare more accessible for those who need it most. After pitching at Bark Tank, Georgetown's premier pitch competition, Shavini has continued to grow OxiWear into a venture rooted in the Jesuit values of service and justice.\n\nWe're thrilled to announce that she will be a featured speaker at the upcoming EmpowerHER Members Session on August 25th, where she'll be sharing lessons from her entrepreneurial journey.\n\nHer story is proof that the best ventures don't just build products, they build a better world. 🌍\n\n🔗 Learn More About BarkTank: https://bit.ly/4gDLEU8\n🔗Learn More About OxiWear: https://bit.ly/4fyw7ns\n\n#barktank #studentfounders #hoyasaxa",
            "media_type": "IMAGE",
            "media_url": "https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/762864261_18337508989269220_1012455908377066411_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=-ECB_ZKst-QQ7kNvwF0EswH&_nc_oc=Adpo4kDJIzAJ2GSOYr2d5vRWCnaP6kWtdV5VcZdd3utCZI9otJ1SFHl24K4lkQdF3zFpUkUbjc378DN5GSGSwO3p&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=AL-3X8kEAAAA&_nc_gid=SJagr1iFeZall-A2QSKpHw&oh=00_AQKfQ2az3LebZs1vcYDVjFnk30XMqbC3QPmbHuGIwNKdxQ&oe=6A9FD0B3",
            "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbdlFzxlDpQ/",
            "timestamp": "2026-07-31T15:24:31+0000"
          }
